      "Language": "bul",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Nalbuphine-midazolam ataractanalgesia has been studied in anaesthesia and postoperative analgesia. Attention has been applied to the efficiency, pharmacological activity, side effects, adverse reactions of nalbuphine as a fentanyl substitute. Preliminary results show that nalbuphine could be used safely as anaesthesia component and as postoperative analgetic."},
